<h2>What’s next?<a href="#whats-next">#</a></h2>
<p>I will be making a concerted effort to link back to more indie creators, those with small web presence and joining webrings/networks that bring back the spirit of the internet as it was originally conceived.  We need more blogs, individual creators, and breaking free from the <a href="https://joshblais.com/blog/how-to-use-social-media/">social media hellscape</a> that plagues us today. The internet is much bigger than 5 sites, and we need to be part of the push back against privacy and security infringing legislation the world over.</p>
<p>This little site aims to be just that little act of resistance.</p>
